The '''Egglocator''' is a {{Common}} tool purchasable through the Chocolate Shop. It is used to locate [[Chocolate Rabbit Egg]]s during [[Hoppity's Hunt]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Egglocator''' can be bought for {{Gold|7,500,000 Chocolate}} in the [[Chocolate Shop]], provided the player's [[Chocolate Factory]] is at least level 2.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|rarity = common
|item_ability_name = Egglocator
|item_ability_activation = RIGHT CLICK
|item_ability_description = Points towards the nearest unclaimed {{Green|Chocolate Rabbit Egg}}!
|item_ability_cooldown = 5s
}}
When used during [[Hoppity's Hunt]], the '''Egglocator''' creates a trail of particle effects pointing in the direction of the nearest [[Chocolate Rabbit Egg]] in the current island that the player hasn't found yet.

